# ...apart from the parity fixtures the instrumented tests compare against. They
# are JPEGs on purpose: Pillow wrote them, and the tests check that this app's own
# codec reproduces those bytes, so they have to be in the repository.
!app/src/androidTest/assets/parity/*.jpg
# The two pictures the README shows - the screenshot and the download badge - are
# the only PNGs that belong in the repository; everything else matching above is
# glitch output or a sweep.
!/screenshot.png
!assets/images/*.png
app/release/*
